# Deliberately cheap: lint-staged fixes formatting and auto-fixable lint
# problems on the STAGED files only, so they land in the commit that caused
# them. No build, no test suite — the full gate runs on pre-push.
#
# Auto-fixing has to happen here rather than on pre-push: by push time the
# code is already committed, so a fixer would write changes the commit does
# not contain, leaving you pushing unformatted code with a dirty tree.
npx lint-staged
